          "text": "Reported associated and red-flag symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No left-sided symptoms. Denies gait disturbance, limb heaviness, saddle symptoms, bowel or bladder incontinence or retention, bilateral symptoms, Lhermitte symptom, fine motor decline, weight loss, fevers, night sweats, or trauma."
      }
    },
    {
